<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI23-BLOCK-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI23-BLOCK-001" ;
  triage:title "Sub-task 4 own-IP/advertised-IP peer-TCP write proof not implemented" ;
  triage:description "Sprint AI.23 sub-task 4 requires a daemon-pair integration helper proving a write addressed to <self>@<team>.<advertised-ip> enters the peer HTTP listener and executes ApiRouter::route(..., Peer, ...), with a required structural boundary test that localhost/own-IP are not matched by a dedicated production branch before the peer adapter. This is also an explicit acceptance criterion. Commit 80da43238523398d4a5eede54c41b5bdcef1df96 implements sub-tasks 1/2/3/5 but contains no advertised_ip/own-IP daemon-pair helper, test, or boundary check anywhere in the tree." ;
